# an edge of the second comparison hands on what the test has proven of the value. A look at a loop types the parameter that takes it by the comparison as it is written, so no edge of a chain may hand on a proof: the chain ends in front of that comparison, and one link is no chain of three
# function pick(kind) { if (kind === 1) return 10; else if (kind === 4) return kind; else if (kind === 9) return 30; return 20; }   with the proof written by hand: the front end hands one on where a field of a local is compared
